        <h3>🎁 Bringing "Gifts"</h3>
        <p><strong>What it looks like:</strong> [Add description]</p>
        <p><strong>Why they do it:</strong> [Add explanation]</p>
        <p><strong>What it means:</strong> [Add meaning]</p>
      </div>

      <div class="behavior-explanation">
        <h3>📦 Sitting in Boxes</h3>
        <p><strong>What it looks like:</strong> [Add description]</p>
        <p><strong>Why they do it:</strong> [Add explanation]</p>
        <p><strong>What it means:</strong> [Add meaning]</p>
      </div>

      <div class="behavior-explanation">
        <h3>🌙 Zoomies (Midnight Crazies)</h3>
        <p><strong>What it looks like:</strong> [Add description]</p>
        <p><strong>Why they do it:</strong> [Add explanation]</p>
        <p><strong>What it means:</strong> [Add meaning]</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="problem-behaviors">
      <h2>Addressing Problem Behaviors</h2>

      <div class="problem-card">
        <h3>🪴 Scratching Furniture</h3>
        <p><strong>Why:</strong> [Add reason]</p>
        <p><strong>Solutions:</strong> [Add solutions]</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card">
        <h3>😾 Aggression</h3>
        <p><strong>Types:</strong> [Add types of aggression]</p>
        <p><strong>Solutions:</strong> [Add solutions]</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card">
        <h3>😿 Excessive Meowing</h3>
        <p><strong>Causes:</strong> [Add causes]</p>
        <p><strong>Solutions:</strong> [Add solutions]</p>
      </div>

